X:1
T:Modo 1: Mi bemol (Mi♭) Jónico (Mayor)
% Familia Mayor | Carácter: Brillante y luminoso | Fórmula: 1 - 2 - 3 - 4 - 5 - 6 - 7
%%barsperstaff 2
M:4/2
L:1/8
Q:1/2=90
K:Eb
V:1 clef=treble
%%score 1
(EFGA Bcde) (fedc BAGF) | (GABc defg) (agfe dcBA) |
(Bcde fgab) (c'bag fedc) | (defg abc'd') (e'd'c'b agfe) |
(defg abc'd') (c'bag fedc) | (Bcde fgab) (agfe dcBA) |
(GABc defg) (fedc BAGF) | (EFGA Bcde) (dcBA GFE2) |]

X:2
